Package: Phase1DesignDecision
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Phase I Dose-Finding Simulation Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Luyuan Wang <researcher@example.com>
Maintainer: Luyuan Wang <researcher@example.com>
Description: Simulates, evaluates, and compares multiple Phase I dose-finding designs (3+3, CRM, BOIN) using powerful Monte Carlo simulations. Provides a fully interactive Shiny dashboard and exported programmatic simulation wrappers for clinical trial planning.
